  "_places_comment": "Where an offer went, so it can be found again months later. Checked as an exact list because the risk is not missing one, it is inventing one: a journal full of half-read map furniture is worse than one that cannot be searched by place. The 'from fast charger' badge on the Uber card and the '(2 orders)' after the Papa John's name are both things a looser reader would have swallowed.",
